~ start
Vendor: [#happy] Hey there!
Midnight: [#surprised] !!!
Vendor: No need to panic! I'm not gonna hurt ya or anything!
Midnight: [#tired] ...
Vendor: Name's Stell. I'm the vendor of this here... uh... dungeon shop.
Vendor: Feel free to ask me anything!
- What are these items? => vendor_response
- How did you transform? => vendor_response
- The errors? [if GlobalPlayer.get_flag(&"iEvilScore") > 0 /] => vendor_error
- Nothing => vendor_exit
=> END

~ vendor_response
Vendor: [#confused] Sorry?
Vendor: I don't quite understand you, apologies. => vendor_exit
=> END

~ vendor_error
ERROR: [#vendor] It stares at through the eyes of its new friend.
ERROR: [#vendor] What does it want?
ERROR: [#vendor] Well, you'll be meeting soon enough.
ERROR: [#vendor] Only {{3 - GlobalPlayer.get_flag(&"iEvilScore")}} more times...
=> vendor_exit

~ vendor_exit
Vendor: Well, if you need anything else, I'll be in this dungeon 'til you're out.
Vendor: [#happy] Farewell!
$> GlobalPlayer.set_bool_flag(&"bVendorMet", true)
=> END
